WEBVTT

00:01:57.407 --> 00:02:01.064
And it's the fear of the dark.

00:02:03.717 --> 00:02:05.866
We hate uncertainty.

00:02:06.384 --> 00:02:08.344
We hate to not know.

00:02:08.368 --> 00:02:09.534
We hate it.

00:02:09.558 --> 00:02:10.997
Think about horror films.

00:02:11.021 --> 00:02:13.791
Horror films are always shot in the dark,

00:02:13.815 --> 00:02:15.791
in the forest,

00:02:15.815 --> 00:02:17.053
at night,

00:02:17.077 --> 00:02:18.348
in the depths of the sea,

00:02:18.372 --> 00:02:19.982
the blackness of space.

00:02:20.539 --> 00:02:23.870
And the reason is because
dying was easy during evolution.

00:02:23.894 --> 00:02:25.815
If you weren't sure that was a predator,

00:02:25.839 --> 00:02:26.989
it was too late.

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:30.033
Your brain evolved to predict.